    "detailed_description": "<h1>Super Hot Cube!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/dac4bba2c538419e696628c36021f743.avif?t=1746382253\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Hot Cube is an intense challenge for most mortals. Navigate a relentless cage of fast-paced traps, master precision platforming, and use your gravitational powers to survive. Are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/15b489aa1283728938e1ad861a010109.poster.avif?t=1746382253\" width=600 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/15b489aa1283728938e1ad861a010109.webm?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/15b489aa1283728938e1ad861a010109.mp4?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Super Hot Cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Hot Cube is a fast-paced test of skill and precision. Navigate an endless cage of traps, using your gravitational powers to outmaneuver obstacles. Each level challenges your reflexes, strategy, and determination to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/f0b096a54ac1533c11eeac59560a04ba.poster.avif?t=1746382253\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/f0b096a54ac1533c11eeac59560a04ba.webm?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/f0b096a54ac1533c11eeac59560a04ba.mp4?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With sleek design and dynamic gameplay, Super Hot Cube is endlessly addictive. Whether collecting coins, advancing stages, or surviving infinite mode, one question remains: do you have what it takes to beat the next level?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Hot Cube is an intense challenge for most mortals. Navigate a relentless cage of fast-paced traps, master precision platforming, and use your gravitational powers to survive. Are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/15b489aa1283728938e1ad861a010109.poster.avif?t=1746382253\" width=600 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/15b489aa1283728938e1ad861a010109.webm?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/15b489aa1283728938e1ad861a010109.mp4?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Super Hot Cube</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Hot Cube is a fast-paced test of skill and precision. Navigate an endless cage of traps, using your gravitational powers to outmaneuver obstacles. Each level challenges your reflexes, strategy, and determination to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/f0b096a54ac1533c11eeac59560a04ba.poster.avif?t=1746382253\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/f0b096a54ac1533c11eeac59560a04ba.webm?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374670/extras/f0b096a54ac1533c11eeac59560a04ba.mp4?t=1746382253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 